## Data augmentation - rotate / flip

The augmented histology patch dataset was generated using Roboflow augmentation.

Dataset download link:
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1afGDmQY-AVSFnIs_jFaXH4njMdEy8KwL/view?usp=sharing

Augmentation settings:

* Hue +-5
* Saturation +-5
* Brightness +- 10 
* Resize 224×224
* 2x image generation
